{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive personal diary.<br>A quiet world of scattered memories, feelings, and fragments of thought.<br>Story pieces tucked between crayons, stones, twigs, leaves, and flowers\u2014bits of life gathered across four cities we happened to be passing through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, creatures drift with their own rhythms, butterflies ask strange questions, and characters mumble absurdities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An honest collection, a glimpse into the lives of three devs trying to shape the intangible\u2014searching for something real.<strong><br><br>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Platformer Exploration</strong>: Navigate a uniquely crafted, procedurally generated world designed for infinite platforming and moments of quiet discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Unique Elements</strong>: Gather hand-drawn creatures, personal memories, and fragments of experiences that add depth to the journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Opinionated Characters</strong>: Interact with characters who share their distinct perspectives, enriching the sense of connection within the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Storytelling</strong>: Uncover pieces of a personal narrative about self-discovery, persistence, and growth, woven naturally into the infinite exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Worlds</strong>: Experience a dynamic environment that changes with every cycle, offering fresh opportunities for exploration and reflection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/a0a2047c969af99db3fbfd117731649a.poster.avif?t=1735998988\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/a0a2047c969af99db3fbfd117731649a.webm?t=1735998988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/a0a2047c969af99db3fbfd117731649a.mp4?t=1735998988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect poorly drawn creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/66da2a0bf4b516bbe8cce35831caf28a.poster.avif?t=1735998988\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/66da2a0bf4b516bbe8cce35831caf28a.webm?t=1735998988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/66da2a0bf4b516bbe8cce35831caf28a.mp4?t=1735998988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect memories and thoughts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/7347d35b9c8cd450ee63038b86ccd281.poster.avif?t=1735998988\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/7347d35b9c8cd450ee63038b86ccd281.webm?t=1735998988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/7347d35b9c8cd450ee63038b86ccd281.mp4?t=1735998988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph